  ▎ slurmdbd.conf template, and fix README partition examples using unquoted yes that would render as True in slurm.conf.

  ▎ pxe_stack: Fix missing --- markers in diskful task files, boolean values (yes/no → true/false), missing FQCN in Clonezilla tasks, wrong Apache group variable in Ubuntu/Debian tasks, double slash in Debian preseed URL, wrong ignition
